      "widgets_values": [
        "SWAN STUDIOS - KREA 2 CHARACTER STILLS  (runs on YOUR 5090, costs nothing)\n\nMakes the PICTURES that feed the H3 video graph. Size is 1280x704 on\npurpose: finished stills drop straight into nodes A / C of\n'01 SWAN - H3 local - First + Last Frame'.\n\nEDIT the prompt node, hit Run. ~2s per image after first load.\nModels load into VRAM only when you press Run - having this workflow\nopen costs NOTHING. Switching between this and H3 swaps models\nautomatically (the first switch each way takes a moment).\n\nThe LoRA node is BYPASSED by default (shown purple). When your\ncharacter LoRA exists in Z:\\AI-Weights\\ComfyUI\\loras: click the node,\npress Ctrl+B to un-bypass, pick the file. Ctrl+B again = off.\nRecipe stays: 8 steps / cfg 1.0 / euler / simple. No mu knob exists.\n\nCHARACTER (AVATAR) PIPELINE\n  1. curate 15-30 images of ONE face (generate them right here)\n  2. train a character LoRA once - separate install, see\n     Install-Krea2-Training-NOTES.md next to the ComfyUI folder\n  3. un-bypass the LoRA node -> the same person, any scene, forever\n  4. two stills -> H3 first/last frame -> movie of your character"
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    }
